{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And when men struggle</b> — Two times here and elsewhere: וכי יחדיו כי ינצו אנשים יחדו איש ואחיו (and when they struggle together, when men struggle together, a man and his brother). Just as there it is monetary — for we expound 'and you shall cut off her hand' as monetary — so too here it is monetary, for they intended to kill this one but killed that one: exempt from death and liable monetarily."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:54.838148809Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}